  "description": "The E-Horizon Sport 30 is a fully equipped e-trekking bike with perfectly integrated components. It includes features such as LED lights with a rear brake light function that increase rider safety in urban environments. The rear carrier is approved for 27 kg and child transportation in combination with a Thule Yepp (Nexxt) 2 maxi seat. The classic derailleur drivetrain for efficient pedaling and shifting is a lightweight and proven concept, and the hydraulic disc brakes offer superior braking power and modulation even in adverse weather conditions.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line electric drive system offers dynamic support.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging, while the battery cover remains on the bike to protect the empty battery bay from the elements. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
